Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ops manager ka pehla tool — Sales tab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.39,0:00:05.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Yaha aap har sales voucher dekh sakte hain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.09,0:00:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Upar filters hain — date range, salesman, customer, category.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.92,0:00:11.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Filter lagate hi list update ho jaati hai.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.56,0:00:15.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Kisi bhi voucher pe click kariye — details khul jaayenge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.13,0:00:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Items, quantities, rates, total.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:19.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Do buttons upar hain — PDF aur Excel export.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.91,0:00:24.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Dono files aapki company name ke header ke saath download hoti hain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.12,0:00:25.75,Default,,0,0,0,,professional look ke liye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.75,0:00:29.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Ek pro tip Salesman filter lagakar Excel export kariye
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.14,0:00:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,aur monthly performance review ke liye salesman ko share kariye.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.16,0:00:33.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Bahut asaan.
